WEBVTT

00:02:55.762 --> 00:03:02.552
So, on 22nd of July, 2007, I arrived
in Pune, a city of four million people.

00:03:03.622 --> 00:03:05.762
I had never been out of my village before


00:03:05.762 --> 00:03:08.611
so being in the city for the first time,

00:03:08.611 --> 00:03:11.512
I was mesmerized and excited.

00:03:11.512 --> 00:03:13.213
And scared as well.

00:03:13.213 --> 00:03:15.725
I didn't even know
if I could trust the taxi driver

00:03:15.725 --> 00:03:19.533
while taking the taxi
for the first time in an unknown city.

00:03:21.173 --> 00:03:25.045
Life in the city
was extremely hard at first.

00:03:25.045 --> 00:03:28.603
I was away from my family,
didn't have any friends.

00:03:29.533 --> 00:03:33.641
I had brought very little money with me;
around three and a half dollars.